[{"client_msg_id":"3914305e-0e1b-4059-91f4-7a199696bf56","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ちなみに `\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;\"` は `\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;` に remap してます（デフォルトの `\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;` を上書きしてしまっているけど今の所利便性が勝っている）","ts":"1637241976.075200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9QeRF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83c51004-efbb-4416-b7d6-053651b14e12","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あ、そうか、remapしてしまえばよかったんだ…何年もVimmerやってるというのに","ts":"1637241892.073800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FA2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2dfa5725-976f-4348-9508-886461277bd8","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"`\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;+` は面倒なので `\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;\u0026lt;Space\u0026gt;` に remap してしまったなあ","ts":"1637241851.072800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k15nS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a174484f-a4ef-48d8-b98a-7222536eb452","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"クリップボードマネージャ、色々あるけどなかなか難しいなという気持ち","ts":"1637235481.071500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ODsV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9fcdb813-fb3c-4364-a437-af5eebe58eda","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"\u003chttps://wiki.archlinux.jp/index.php/%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AA%E3%83%83%E3%83%97%E3%83%9C%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89\u003e\nこの記事で言うところのCLIPBOARDですね\nセレクションってPRIMARYだけを指すのかと思ってたら違った","ts":"1637235390.071100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uRxet"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e59f3218-86d0-49db-a181-4cef58feb477","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"消えてしまうのはセレクション?","ts":"1637235243.069700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delet