uinu.net/2014/01/29/how-to-turn-off-paste-mode-when-becoming-normal-mode-on-vim/index.html\u003e\nautocmdと組み合わせるのか。なるほど。","ts":"1637229239.044400","attachments":[{"fallback":"踊る犬.netブログ (旧): [vim] 挿入モードからノーマルモードに戻った時にペーストモードを自動で解除する方法","id":1,"title":"[vim] 挿入モードからノーマルモードに戻った時にペーストモードを自動で解除する方法","title_link":"https://archive.craftz.dog/blog.odoruinu.net/2014/01/29/how-to-turn-off-paste-mode-when-becoming-normal-mode-on-vim/index.html","text":"vimで長い文字列をコピペする時は、オートインデントやオートコンプリートをオフにするために、:set past…","image_url":"https://odoruinu.files.wordpress.com/2014/01/vim.png","blocks":null,"ts":1391007160,"service_name":"踊る犬.netブログ (旧)","service_icon":"https://archive.craftz.dog/odoruinu.files.wordpress.com/2016/12/dogad83.png?w=180","from_url":"https://archive.craftz.dog/blog.odoruinu.net/2014/01/29/how-to-turn-off-paste-mode-when-becoming-normal-mode-on-vim/index.html","original_url":"https://archive.craftz.dog/blog.odoruinu.net/2014/01/29/how-to-turn-off-paste-mode-when-becoming-normal-mode-on-vim/index.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z6qBB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5a008dc-ceb9-4bf8-ad35-4f4336065c4d","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"をを","ts":"1637228457.043800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/DTNc"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *InsertLeave*\nInsertLeave                     挿入モードを抜けた直後。CTRL-O |i_CTRL-O| を\n                                使ったときにも発生する。|i_CTRL-C| のときは発\n                                生しない。\n```","ts":"1637228443.043500","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"d6bfe99f-4e85-44ea-8eab-9cb103e706ee","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h InsertLeave","ts":"1637228443.043400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AkPe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f70dc40-ca9f-4eec-9e12-ad1c8243e38b","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"insert modeから抜ける時ってどうやってhookをかけるのですか?","ts":"1637228429.043100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ris88"}]},{"client_msg_id":"590c6365-3d4b-4dd1-a443-b8a5d9e9ff92","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"insert mode から抜けたときに自動で `set nopaste` を実行する、みたいな設定はよく見かけますね。 set paste が必要になる場面が限られている人にとっては便利。","ts":"1637225959.042400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"44uG8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21293244-2300-41c2-8e70-eca9e85be501","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"をを、`set pastetoggle=\u0026lt;F11\u0026gt;` で便利になった。","ts":"1637223904.041100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aIR"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                *'pastetoggle'* *'pt'*\n'pastetoggle' 'pt'      文字列  (既定では \"\")\n                        グローバル\n        空でないとき、オプション 'paste' を切り替えるキー列を指定する。これは\n        以下のようなマッピングの設定に似ている。  \n            :map {keys} :set invpaste\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\n        ここで {keys} は 'pastetoggle' の値が当てはまる。\n        違うのは、こちらは 'paste' がオンでも有効だという点だ。\n        'pastetoggle' は挿入モードとノーマルモードで有効だが、コマンドライン\n        モードでは無効である。\n        マッピングが最初に調べられるので、'pastetoggle' を上書きできる。しかし\n        'paste' がオンならば挿入モードでマッピングは無視されるので、以下のよう\n        な設定が可能である。  \n            :map \u0026lt;F10\u0026gt; :set paste\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\n            :map \u0026lt;F11\u0026gt; :set nopaste\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\n            :imap \u0026lt;F10\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-O\u0026gt;:set paste\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\n            :imap \u0026lt;F11\u0026gt; \u0026lt;nop\u0026gt;\n            :set pastetoggle=\u0026lt;F11\u0026gt;\n        こうすると \u0026lt;F10\u0026gt; でPasteモードが始まり、\u0026lt;F11\u0026gt; でPasteモードが終わる。\n        Note Pasteモードで \u0026lt;F10\u0026gt; を入力すると \"\u0026lt;F10\u0026gt;\" が挿入されるので注意。こ\n        れは、Pasteモードでは 'pastetoggle' で指定されたキー列以外は全てそのま\n        ま挿入されるからである。\n        このオプションの値が複数バイトからなる場合、'ttimeoutlen' が適用される。\n```","ts":"1637223409.039800","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"4ba76d08-9a3d-4ae6-83e4-013e82b20df6","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":":h pastetoggle","ts":"1637223409.039700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ysG="}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"E149: 残念ですが pastetogle にはヘルプがありません","ts":"1637223392.039300","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"739976d5-6c94-42cc-a69a-c8785917caa8","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":":h pastetogle","ts":"1637223391.039200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p6d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b522a21-c6aa-4647-bd9c-6935125bcc58","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"`pastetoggle` ではダメでしょうか？","ts":"1637223369.038800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kb6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c3e3059-77fd-4c21-b267-2f6319526da1","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":":set pasteしていると、補完が効かないとか副作用があるのでこまっていたので質問しました","ts":"1637223361.038700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pwg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27a13e66-82dd-40d8-a627-b0843c08eb1b","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"ドキュメントをvimで書いていると、:set pasteと:set nopasteをトグルで切り替えるキーバインドが欲しくなるのですが、どうやって実現するのが良いでしょうか。","ts":"1637223244.037500","edited":{"user":"U013QL1RAPN","ts":"1637223282.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ENlj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fff360c8-06db-4aaf-bb89-339ebed22d6f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとうございます","ts":"1637200985.036300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WO2Sx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf414edf-2a50-440e-8405-7a645c796778","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"おお、できました","ts":"1637200982.036000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7QKV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d22d6be-c3db-4337-a70a-8cc2e61abf6e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1637200959.035800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rqgl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11416ab5-6db8-431a-8a38-166d5784aa23","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"すればよさそう","ts":"1637200656.035600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JBb2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ae386d5-3be6-4d1e-8973-4f6c8c479db8","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"setl foldmethod=marker\nsetl foldmarker=\u0026lt;details\u0026gt;,\u0026lt;/details\u0026gt;","ts":"1637200646.035400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U016GRZN0GJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fFc0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a5d699c-81cc-4106-9495-b29779615656","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ご存じの方がもし居たら…\nMarkdownで\u0026lt;details\u0026gt;をfoldしてくれるプラグインってあったりしますか？\nplasticboy/vim-markdown を試してみたけど、だめでした\n\n```\u0026lt;details\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;summary\u0026gt;title\u0026lt;/summary\u0026gt;\nsome \n\u0026lt;/details\u0026gt;```","ts":"1637200522.034700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M50"}]}]
